---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/github';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Exports & managing analyses"
  description="Export Semper results and manage analyses on Home."
  path="/manual/exports-manage"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 3rem">
    <p class="crumb">
      <a href={withBase('/manual')}>← Manual</a>
    </p>
    <h2>Exports &amp; managing analyses</h2>
    <p class="sub">Share targets, Home list actions, and Settings that affect runs.</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h3>Exports</h3>
      <p><strong>Share</strong> offers several targets. Every chooser can <strong>Save to Files</strong>.</p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Export</th>
            <th>Contents</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Result photo</td>
            <td>One annotated PNG of the current field and frame</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>All field photos</td>
            <td>Five PNGs for this frame, zipped</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Field animations (GIF)</td>
            <td>Five looping GIFs on a whole-sequence scale, zipped</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>PDF report</td>
            <td>Every frame plus a telemetry page</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>CSV data</td>
            <td>
              <code>x_px,y_px,u_px,v_px,exx,eyy,exy,znssd</code> — sweeps add subset, step, window
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Everything (.zip)</td>
            <td>Photos + animations + fields + CSV + PDF</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>
        Build on the CSV. Coordinates and displacements are image pixels; filter on
        <code>znssd</code> to drop poorly correlated points.
      </p>

      <h3>Managing analyses</h3>
      <p>
        Home lists analyses. Tap to open, long-press to select, rename, or delete. Pull down to
        sync. <strong>+</strong> starts a new analysis.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Quota.</strong> The chip reads <code>Using N of M analyses</code>. At the cap, email
        support or delete something and tap <strong>Re-check</strong>.
      </p>

      <h3>Useful Settings</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Max frames</strong> — 10–150, default 50; caps frames per analysis</li>
        <li><strong>Save to cloud</strong> — queue uploads when online</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Help &amp; support</strong> — Manual / community links and email for private
          account issues
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top: 1.5rem">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={withBase('/manual/faq')}>FAQ</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={withBase('/manual/sweeps-results')}>Back</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
